@startuml
title C4 LinkML -> OpenAPI -> orval / hey-api -> TS types + zod
participant "LinkML schema" as LML
participant "gen-openapi (template paths)" as GO
participant "FastAPI /openapi.json" as FA
participant "orval / hey-api" as GEN
participant "TS client + zod" as TS
LML -> GO : components only; paths come from a hand-written template
GO -> GEN : 3.0.3 via JSON Schema gen: uri -> format uri, date -> format date, enums as enum
GO -> GEN : 3.1.0 via Pydantic: linkml_meta stripped (openapigen.py:336)
LML -> FA : generated Pydantic classes used in routes
FA -> GEN : linkml_meta leaks in schemas; IRIs plain string; Optional -> anyOf null
GEN -> TS : enums -> string unions; date -> z.iso.date or Date (useDates); uri -> z.url()
note over GEN, TS : uriorcurie has no format; decimal -> number (precision loss); references are plain strings
@enduml
